    "Id": "chassisdef_ice_ferret_IFR-Prime",
    "Name": "Ice Ferret",
    "Details": "First produced in 2948, the Ice Ferret is a medium scout OmniMech often employed as a head hunter or strike unit. A 45 ton Clan OmniMech, the Ice Ferret is powered by a 360-rated XL Engine and has 9.5 tons of pod space thanks to a combination of Endo Steel, an XL Engine and Ferro-Fibrous. The Ice Ferret IFR-Prime is armed with an ER PPC, ER Small Laser and a Streak SRM-2. An Active Probe improves the Ice Ferrets scouting capabilities.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Improved Sensors</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.04</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Omni</color>",
